    "BravyiTimeReversalMoment[\\[Alpha], cvr, {k1, k2, ...}] returns the \
\\[Alpha]^th (\\[Alpha] \\[Element] \\[DoubleStruckCapitalR]) moment of \
partial time reversal over given fermion modes (species) {k1, k2, ...} \
\\[Subset] {1, 2, ..., n} for the fermionic Gaussian state characterized by 2 \
n*2 n Majorana covariance matrix cvr. BravyiTimeReversalMoment[\\[Alpha], \
grn, {k$1, k$2, $$}] is equivalent to BravyiTimesReversaMoment[\\[Alpha], \
BravyiCovariance@grn, {k1, k2, ...}] for single-particle Green's function \
matrix grn (NambuGreen). BravyiTimeReversalMoment[\\[Alpha], \
BravyiState[...], {k1, k2, ...}] is equivalent to \
BravyiTimeReversalMoment[\\[Alpha], BravyiCovariance@BravhiState[...], {k1, \
